{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb8\u00a0<strong>DOUBLE WHAMMY\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfb8</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd person Guitar Combat - Battle monsters in fast-paced, intense dream missions using electric guitars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish movements - Grind rails with your guitars &amp; glide with a guitar cable lasso</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a guitar shop - Fix guitars, clean the shop, and deal with demanding customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom guitar designer - Shape and paint guitars from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guitar Freeplay Mode - Input your own guitar tabs and watch your character shred</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/edf6e80c8b962f0e4d428bb8b11312f5.poster.avif?t=1758750972\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/edf6e80c8b962f0e4d428bb8b11312f5.webm?t=1758750972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/edf6e80c8b962f0e4d428bb8b11312f5.mp4?t=1758750972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double Whammy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Whammy</strong> is a genre-bending guitar action game that follows Gigi, an aspiring guitarist, as she balances her day job at a guitar shop with nightly battles in the dream realm. \ud83c\udfb8\ud83c\udfb8 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discovering an old guitar instruction book, Gigi opens a portal to the dream realm filled with otherworldly threats. Though each night's trial ends at sunrise, the damage her guitars take carries over into the real world. To survive the next battle, she must work at the guitar shop to repair her broken guitars and acquire new gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six-String Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design wild custom guitars from scratch - shape them, paint them, and take them into battle or jam with them in the rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune, polish, and repair guitars in mini-games at the guitar shop. Serve customers, earn money, and prepare your guitar loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night time, grab your favorite guitar and dive into fast-paced dream realm combat. Smash and shred through monsters!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2984800?t=1758750972","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758750972","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/ec83bb2001d0dc5ed917e7c2c17b1dbc83fb24d0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758750972","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/ec83bb2001d0dc5ed917e7c2c17b1dbc83fb24d0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758750972","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Captions available","id":13},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83c\udfb8\u00a0<strong>DOUBLE WHAMMY\u00a0</strong>\ud83c\udfb8</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3rd person Guitar Combat - Battle monsters in fast-paced, intense dream missions using electric guitars</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylish movements - Grind rails with your guitars &amp; glide with a guitar cable lasso</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run a guitar shop - Fix guitars, clean the shop, and deal with demanding customers</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Custom guitar designer - Shape and paint guitars from scratch</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guitar Freeplay Mode - Input your own guitar tabs and watch your character shred</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/edf6e80c8b962f0e4d428bb8b11312f5.poster.avif?t=1758750972\" width=540 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/edf6e80c8b962f0e4d428bb8b11312f5.webm?t=1758750972\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/extras/edf6e80c8b962f0e4d428bb8b11312f5.mp4?t=1758750972\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Double Whammy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Double Whammy</strong> is a genre-bending guitar action game that follows Gigi, an aspiring guitarist, as she balances her day job at a guitar shop with nightly battles in the dream realm. \ud83c\udfb8\ud83c\udfb8 </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After discovering an old guitar instruction book, Gigi opens a portal to the dream realm filled with otherworldly threats. Though each night's trial ends at sunrise, the damage her guitars take carries over into the real world. To survive the next battle, she must work at the guitar shop to repair her broken guitars and acquire new gear.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Six-String Playground</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Design wild custom guitars from scratch - shape them, paint them, and take them into battle or jam with them in the rhythm game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tune, polish, and repair guitars in mini-games at the guitar shop. Serve customers, earn money, and prepare your guitar loadout.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At night time, grab your favorite guitar and dive into fast-paced dream realm combat. Smash and shred through monsters!</p>","developers":["SGI"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2984800/dfe49d38ac6dd23ee02b5c7a1ffa078a8b17787f/header.jpg?t=1758750972","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"All rights reserved. SGI.","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2984800/917731376/fe94afe045bd4efd7d026ad0650784e0c3b9770d/1750955296/dash_av1.mpd?t=1747876797","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2984800/917731376/fe94afe045bd4efd7d026ad0650784e0c3b9770d/1750955296/dash_h264.mpd?t=1747876797","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2984800/917731376/fe94afe045bd4efd7d026ad0650784e0c3b9770d/1750955296/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1747876797","id":257143085,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143085/movie480.mp4?t=1747876797","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143085/movie_max.mp4?t=1747876797"},"name":"2025 May Montage 1.2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257143085/5954d7c969356478ba97682d72f4ef5fc83d0010/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1747876797","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143085/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1747876797","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257143085/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1747876797"}}],"name":"Double Whammy","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Process